# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Feature worktrees (git worktree add branches/<name>) — big features
# evolve in isolation here; the parent never tracks them. Merged back at
# the end. See feature-worktree-workflow.
/branches/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Node / pnpm (lands in later commits)
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.svelte-kit/
build/
dist/

# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Vendored SoapySDR sources/builds (provisioned by scripts/bootstrap.sh,
# which builds via scripts/build-soapysdr.sh or symlinks the primary worktree)
/soapysdr
# Upstream Soapy source tree unpacked locally during development
/soapysdr-src

# Per-distro package build staging (regenerated by packaging/run_matrix.sh)
/packaging/build-ctx/
# Built packages + per-target build logs (produced by run_matrix.sh)
/dist/

# Upstream decoder codebases cloned for WASM-port feasibility research
/research/

# Per-developer Claude Code state
/.claude/

# Scratch material that isn't part of the curated `samples/sigidwiki/`
# corpus — audio captures, screenshots, notes, vendor installers.
# `samples/uhf/` is now curated (drives nbfm_ctcss_e2e) — tracked.
/samples/audio1/
/notes
/notes/
/Screenshot*.png
/SDRplay_RSP_API-*.run

# Dev-server logs from `./run.sh` — regenerated on every start.
/dev-server.log
/web/dev-server.log

# Ad-hoc debug presets that hard-code dev-machine paths (e.g. /tmp/...)
# — kept locally for reproduction, not part of the shipped catalog.
/flowgraphs/aprs-debug.json

# fldigi Emscripten bridge — generated by blocks/native/fldigi/emscripten/build.sh
web/src/lib/wasm/fldigi/fldigi.mjs
web/src/lib/wasm/fldigi/fldigi.wasm

# whisper.cpp Emscripten module — generated by blocks/native/whisper/emscripten/build.sh
web/src/lib/wasm/whisper/whisper.mjs
web/src/lib/wasm/whisper/whisper.wasm
# vendored whisper.cpp sources (provisioned by scripts/bootstrap.sh at the
# pinned commit; see blocks/native/whisper/README.md)
blocks/native/whisper/vendor
# emscripten CMake build tree for whisper.cpp
blocks/native/whisper/build-em/
# large ggml models (fetched into static/, not committed)
web/static/models/
run.log

# sherpa-onnx Emscripten ASR module (light/browser STT engine) — generated by
# blocks/native/sherpa/emscripten/build.sh. The .data bakes the ~42 MB model,
# so none of this is committed; bootstrap/build provision it. The co-located
# sherpa-onnx.d.ts is hand-written and stays tracked (mirrors whisper.d.ts).
web/src/lib/wasm/sherpa/sherpa-onnx-asr.js
web/src/lib/wasm/sherpa/sherpa-onnx-wasm-main-asr.js
web/src/lib/wasm/sherpa/sherpa-onnx-wasm-main-asr.wasm
web/src/lib/wasm/sherpa/sherpa-onnx-wasm-main-asr.data
# vendored sherpa-onnx sources (provisioned by scripts/bootstrap.sh at a pinned
# tag; see blocks/native/sherpa/README.md) + its emscripten build tree
blocks/native/sherpa/vendor
blocks/native/sherpa/vendor/sherpa-onnx/build-wasm-simd-asr/

# Large local capture corpora (STT differential); regenerate via ferrite-ctl capture
/samples/*.wav

# Repo-local screenshot artifacts (Screenshot button / ferrite-ctl view)
/screenshots/

# Repo-local AI sidecar conversation state — per-session raw event
# transcripts (<session_id>.jsonl, the conversation-state authority) +
# the readable per-turn log. Same convention as /screenshots/.
/.ferrite-ai-state/
